   "title": "HD Hyundai launches autonomous vessel developed with Anduril",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/business/20261115/hd-hyundai-launches-autonomous-vessel-developed-with-anduril",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
