   "title": "2027: Inuwa Yahaya flags off APC campaign, targets 1m votes for Tinubu",
   "url": "https://www.vanguardngr.com/2026/11/2027-inuwa-yahaya-flags-off-apc-campaign-targets-1m-votes-for-tinubu/",
   "domain": "vanguardngr.com",
