   "title": "US floats Ukraine ceding land to Russia in exchange for NATO membership: Zelenskyy",
   "url": "https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/14/us-floats-ukraine-ceding-land-to-russia-in-exchange-for-nato-membership-zelenskyy",
