   "title": "Seoul freezes fuel price caps amid Mideast tensions",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/economy/policy/20261113/seoul-freezes-fuel-price-caps-amid-mideast-tensions",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
